      "tut_quick_n1": "The bot token is minted locally and stored only in the SQLite ledger; rotate it by re-creating the credential in the console.",
      "tut_sub": "Four paths, the same engine: a production Linux box, a Mac you keep running, a development checkout, or the three clicks inside the console.",
